.area
  = label_tag :guest_phone, "Phone Number", class: 'block text-sm font-bold text-secondary mb-1'
  .md:flex.gap-4
    = select_tag :guest_area_code, options_for_select(show_codes, '+1'), class: 'mb-3 md:mb-auto w-full md:w-auto px-3 py-2 border border-secondary rounded-xl focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500', required: true, data: { testid: 'guest-area-code' }
    = telephone_field_tag :guest_phone, nil, class: 'flex-grow w-full lg:px-3 px-2 lg:py-2 py-1 border border-secondary rounded-xl focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500', required: true, data: { testid: 'guest-phone' }

.area
  .flex.flex-row.items-center.space-x-2.mt-3
    = check_box_tag :guest_sms, '1', false, class: 'border border-secondary rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-original checked:bg-primary-original', data: { testid: 'guest-sms-checkbox' }
    = label_tag :guest_sms, "Send me text message reminders for this task", class: 'block text-sm font-bold text-secondary mb-1'
  %p{ class: 'text-[11px] ml-2 mt-2' }
    By opting in, you agree to receive recurring automated text messages (from Chesed Train Inc) at the mobile number provided. <b>Consent is not a condition of volunteering.</b> Msg &amp; data rates may apply. Reply STOP to unsubscribe.
